      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "textAnswer is sent only when question is Free_Text, vice-versa for answerOptionIds.\nHere we would send all answered ids in an array. Single choice answer would be sent here in\nan array nevertheless for simplicity of implementation.",
